---
description: VibeModForge entry point for StarCraft Brood War and Warcraft III maps, missions and campaigns
alwaysApply: true
---
Before any map, mission, campaign, race or unit work in this repository, open and read `AGENTS.md` at the repository
root (@AGENTS.md) and follow its mandatory workflow. If you cannot find it, the workspace is not the repository root:
say so instead of continuing. Non-negotiable summary (AGENTS.md is authoritative):
- Read `docs/lessons.md` and `docs/quality-bar.md`, then the game guides in `docs/`.
- Design note from `templates/Design_Note_template.md` next to the map before building.
- Build your own mission script on the repository builders; the examples are pipeline skeletons, never a design.
- Deliver only the ZIP from `python3 tools/deliver.py output/<map>` (refuses on any FAIL). Never edit a check to pass.
- Never touch the user's PC or game without permission. Never port WC3 rules to BW or the other way round.
- Feedback goes into the guides, `docs/lessons.md` and a check in the same turn.
